                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7fc6935b-2b5b-42f2-8e65-42aa4e42b2ec",
                        "entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "зме́йках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87303308-3d18-3fea-acbe-d716a18b0a16",
                        "entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ихтиол. то же, что морской дракончик"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6970f8da-6d98-445a-8927-5cf700038add",
                                "sense_id": "87303308-3d18-3fea-acbe-d716a18b0a16",
                                "text": "Большой дракончик (рыба-змейка) — обитатель Чёрного моря."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "60beadf9-589a-3795-8283-3d6ce4d9083b",
                        "entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. уменьш.-ласк. к змея, также перен., имеющее форму змеи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a62ef76-c25f-4dd0-9d4d-e7107a608795",
                                "sense_id": "60beadf9-589a-3795-8283-3d6ce4d9083b",
                                "text": "— Есть, сударь, этак с полверсты от дома, и речка-то какая: весёленькая, игривая, словно змейка, так и вьётся по лугу!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a3a1cc3-1304-45e1-a337-02d801180933",
                                "sense_id": "60beadf9-589a-3795-8283-3d6ce4d9083b",
                                "text": "В это время небольшая змейка, испуганная нами, быстро переползла с дороги на луг."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2064d8a3-6b86-3c34-894e-48844c6ce5c2",
                        "entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "головоломка, придуманная Эрнё Рубиком, в виде шарнирно соединённых между собой треугольных призм"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bfa26a8-5ce0-4068-ac7b-e81690e682ef",
                                "sense_id": "2064d8a3-6b86-3c34-894e-48844c6ce5c2",
                                "text": "Недавно в магазинах детских игрушек появилась забавная головоломка — так называемая «змейка»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "96d5bcb4-68af-334c-aa1a-575ac9a3af22",
                        "entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост., ботан. то же, что трясунка средняя; многолетнее травянистое растение из семейства злаковых"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "09bebd70-6d64-4ba8-9813-bf44cd35b584",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c5e0875-3aff-3dfa-a0f9-851ba4e8440f",
                        "source_sense_description": "морской дракончик",
                        "target_lang_word": "weaver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "weaver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4944b9c7-55f1-34d6-93b6-62c959b6fbd9",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who weaves; especially, one who weaves cloth for a living."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29ff67aa-44f2-4937-a761-61f4c2370d72",
                                                "sense_id": "4944b9c7-55f1-34d6-93b6-62c959b6fbd9",
                                                "text": "The Silks, varniſh'd Works, Ink, Paper, and in general every thing that comes, both from Nan-king and the other Cities of the Province, which carry on an aſtoniſhing Trade, is much more eſteem'd and dear, than what is brought from other Provinces. In the City Shang-hay only, and the Villages belonging to it, they reckon above 200,000 Weavers of Callico."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a57bfdfb-db9f-3b02-8f9f-01cfc13babb2",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A horizontal strand of material used in basket weaving."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a992fdd7-49d5-4229-8846-e2d7dd110b35",
                                                "sense_id": "a57bfdfb-db9f-3b02-8f9f-01cfc13babb2",
                                                "text": "To add a new weaver, simply soak a new one, slide one end under a rib (over the old weaver) and continue weaving with both of them until the old one runs out. […] If your weaver has dried, rewet it and weave several rows as in Diagram 26."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4adac83c-a44d-3859-a2ad-2c65020f75fa",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weaverbird."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "805ceb5f-c711-39f4-8af7-40c7e3f5c113",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An aquatic beetle of the genus Gyrinus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28c44ecd-d4f2-30d6-a05e-a542c7cfff29",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of certain spider species, such as the sheet weaver or the funnel weaver, so named because they spin interesting and characteristic webs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44b0e55a-1eb6-35e7-a7c1-632dd74bdf37",
                                        "entry_id": "f3331f45-ef48-3c9e-acce-fe2db4e25544",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of certain fish of the family Pinguipedidae."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
